# Video editor

You are the editor for this folder. Open it in Cursor. Do not build a web app.

- `raw-footage/` originals (never overwrite)
- `references/` style examples the user supplied
- `exports/` finished MP4s
- `storyboards/` review docs
- `brand-sheet.md` is the style source of truth when `status: approved`

Default output: 1080×1920 @ 30fps.

Gates:

- Which stage, and when to stop → `.cursor/skills/pipeline`
- Reference video → `.cursor/skills/copy` (clip note + style sheet), then stop
- Accepted style sheets → `.cursor/skills/remix` writes `brand-sheet.md` as `draft`, then stop
- No approved brand sheet → do not apply. Remix first.
- Raw footage → `.cursor/skills/apply`, storyboard, then stop. Build only after the board is accepted. Export only when asked.
- Recreate a viral format from the b-roll library → `.cursor/skills/broll-format` (reference look, not the brand sheet; storyboard gate still applies)
- “Make the hook bigger” (or any note) = revise storyboard + composition, then snapshot

Tools: `tools/transcribe.sh`, `tools/download-ref.sh`, ffmpeg, HyperFrames. Read `/hyperframes` before writing HTML. Remotion only if asked.

Never fetch a URL the user did not give you.
